{"lesson":"alg8-c3-s3-n18","count":20,"exercises":[{"number":"278","source_number":"278","group":null,"text":"278. 设$(x_n)$是等比数列，它的第1项等于$x_1$，公比等于$q$. 用$x_1$和$q$表示下列各项：\na) $x_5$；\nb) $x_{21}$；\nc) $x_{150}$；\nd) $x_m$；\ne) $x_{m+2}$；\nf) $x_{2k+1}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"279","source_number":"279","group":null,"text":"279. 在等比数列$(u_n)$里，$u_1=256$，$q=\\frac{1}{2}$.求：\na) $u_3$；\nb) $u_5$；\nc) $u_{10}$；\nd) $u_n$.","figures":[]},{"number":"280","source_number":"280","group":null,"text":"280. 在等比数列$(b_n)$里，已知它的第1项$b_1$和公比$q$.求$b_n$，设：\na) $b_1=96$，$q=\\frac{1}{2}$，$n=7$；\nb) $b_1=0.125$，$q=-2$，$n=6$；\nc) $b_1=4\\sqrt{2}$，$q=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$，$n=9$；\nd) $b_1=0.003$，$q=\\sqrt{10}$，$n=7$.","figures":[]},{"number":"281","source_number":"281","group":null,"text":"281. 利用通项公式给出等比数列：\na) $b_1=3$，$b_{n+1}=b_n\\cdot2$；\nb) $b_1=4$，$b_{n+1}=b_n\\cdot(-3)$；\nc) $b_1=25$，$b_{n+1}=b_n\\cdot5$；\nd) $b_1=12$，$b_{n+1}=b_n\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"282","source_number":"282","group":null,"text":"282. 证明：数列$(c_n)$是等比数列，设：\na) $c_n=2^n$；\nb) $c_n=5\\times3^n$；\nc) $c_n=3\\times2^{n+1}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"283","source_number":"283","group":null,"text":"283. 求下列等比数列$(b_n)$的第1项，设：\na) $b_8=384$，$q=2$；\nb) $b_6=\\frac{32}{81}$，$q=-\\frac{2}{3}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"284","source_number":"284","group":null,"text":"284. 用$a_5$和公比$q$表示等比数列$(a_n)$的$a_7$、$a_{16}$和$a_{40}$三项.","figures":[]},{"number":"285","source_number":"285","group":null,"text":"285. 求下列等比数列$(b_n)$的公比，设：\na) $b_1=2$，$b_8=256$；\nb) $b_1=5$，$b_9=1280$；\nc) $b_6=25$，$b_8=9$；\nd) $b_4=2$，$b_7=-54$.","figures":[]},{"number":"286","source_number":"286","group":null,"text":"286. 等比数列的第8项等于13，公比等于$-3$. 求它的第10项和第13项.","figures":[]},{"number":"287","source_number":"287","group":null,"text":"287. 在等比数列$(c_n)$里，$c_5=27$，$c_4=9$. 求$c_8$.","figures":[]},{"number":"288","source_number":"288","group":null,"text":"288. 求下列等比数列$(b_n)$的项的序号$n$，设：\na) $b_n=162$，$b_1=2$，$q=3$；\nb) $b_n=10$，$b_1=640$，$q=\\frac{1}{2}$；\nc) $b_n=\\frac{1}{81}$，$b_1=1$，$q=\\frac{1}{3}$；\nd) $b_n=0.002$，$b_1=2$，$q=0.1$.","figures":[]},{"number":"289","source_number":"289","group":null,"text":"289.\na) 在1和16中间插入三个数，使它们和这两个数成等比数列.\nb) 在60和$\\frac{15}{16}$中间插入五个数，使它们和这两个数成等比数列.","figures":[]},{"number":"290","source_number":"290","group":null,"text":"290.\na) 求等比数列0.1，0.3，…中等于218.7的项的序号.\nb) 求等比数列1280，640，…中等于20的项的序号.","figures":[]},{"number":"291","source_number":"291","group":null,"text":"291. 在银行存入1000美元，每年按年利率2%计息一次，并入本金. 在银行定期储蓄4年后存款本利和总额是多少？","figures":[]},{"number":"292","source_number":"292","group":null,"text":"292. 某种处在营养环境中的细菌，每过半小时，1个分裂成2个. 在这种情况下，经过10小时以后，由一个细菌得到多少细菌？","figures":[]},{"number":"293","source_number":"293","group":null,"text":"293. 在试验森林地段，每年增长木材10%. 如果最初的木材数量等于$20\\times10^4\\mathrm{m}^3$，经过6年以后，这个地段的木材数量是多少？","figures":[]},{"number":"294","source_number":"294","group":"复习题","text":"294. 化简：\na) $\\left(-\\frac{16x^{4n+7}}{y^3}\\right)\\div\\left(\\frac{8x^{3n+5}}{y^2}\\right)$；\nb) $\\left(\\frac{81a^{4n-1}}{25}\\right)^3\\cdot\\left(\\frac{5}{27a^{3n-1}}\\right)^4$.","figures":[]},{"number":"295","source_number":"295","group":"复习题","text":"295. 把下列各式分解因式：\na) $4^n-4^{n-2}$；\nb) $9^n-3^{2n-1}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"296","source_number":"296","group":"复习题","text":"296. 约分：\na) $\\frac{9^n-7\\times9^{n-1}}{8}$；\nb) $\\frac{3^{2n+1}-3^{2n-1}}{4\\times3^n}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"297","source_number":"297","group":"复习题","text":"297. 设函数由公式$y=4x^2-5x+7$给出，使这个函数取等于下列各值的$x$值存在吗(在肯定回答的情况下，指出$x$的值)？\na) 3；\nb) 6.","figures":[]}]}
